+- `Mathlib/Analysis/Distribution/DerivNotation.lean`: `Laplacian`.
+- `Mathlib/Analysis/InnerProductSpace/Laplacian.lean`:
+  `instLaplacian` for functions on finite-dimensional real inner-product
